# Sibling projects grouped here on disk for convenience (2026-07-25).
# Each is its own independent git repository with its own remote
# (WebStaffr3.0, smmm) — never tracked, committed, or deployed as part
# of this repo. Kept out of `git add`/`git status` entirely so a nested
# .git is never mistaken for a submodule.
/WebStaffr 3.0/
/social-media-marketing-machine/
